# Rust build artifacts
/target
# The Event Gateway is outside the workspace (see the root Cargo.toml),
# so it builds into its own target directory.
/slack-event-gateway/target
# OpenTofu downloads provider binaries here (hundreds of MB). The rule lives
# with the directory that can contain them rather than with the OpenTofu
# module itself: during stacked work the untracked directory travels across
# branch checkouts, so an ignore added higher up leaves the branches below it
# one `git add <dir>` away from committing a provider binary.
/slack-event-gateway/tofu/.terraform/
**/*.rs.bk

# Coverage
lcov.info
*.profraw

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Local environment variables (never commit)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
